      "statement": "HO 01 09 2019-01 governs Florida policies effective from January 1, 2019 through June 30, 2023, while HO 01 09 2023-07 governs policies effective on or after July 1, 2023; superseded editions remain relevant to policies issued during their own effective periods.",
