      "statement": "The 2019 Florida HO 01 09 endorsement applies its actual-cash-value roof schedule when the roof is ten years old and uses the roof's pre-loss condition; separately, OIR-2019-11 states a 15-year-or-older ACV schedule for the bulletin's administration. Neither age threshold is by itself a blanket exclusion of a covered loss.",
