      "id": "claim_14308ac26baf4177a4f50b25b6d3b400",
      "statement": "The Florida DP 01 09 2021-03 endorsement must be applied separately from the HO editions because it has its own contract controls: a 2% to 10% windstorm-and-hail deductible, 45-day increase notice, 72-hour post-designation Named Storm Period, 10-day and 45-day cancellation notices, 120-day nonrenewal notice, 14-day acknowledgment, 90-business-day decision, 20-business-day accepted-claim payment, a 10-year-or-older roof ACV rule, and a five-year action period.",
